  "local_changes": "File-statistics accumulation uses bounded running native StatsSet state, preserves unknown observations and overflow, and compacts retained variable-length bounds. Empty requested-statistics sets bypass column execution. Nullable root structs retain one empty statistics set per field without publishing unmasked child bounds. Cargo.toml is marked publish=false; license, provenance, README.shardloom.md, focused tests and a crate-local Cargo.lock ignore rule are added. File, array and layout identities remain unchanged."
